# Opening Desk channel <channelAlias> for user <userAlias>
* opening stored user <userAlias> channel <channelAlias> url
* waiting up to "60" seconds for "[data-testid='support-page']" to appear

# Opening Desk ticket <ticketAlias> in channel <channelAlias> for user <userAlias>
* Opening Desk channel <channelAlias> for user <userAlias>
* clicking on stored user <userAlias> ticket <ticketAlias> field "title" in "[data-testid='support-page']"

# Verifying open Desk ticket <ticketAlias> shows its customer email for user <userAlias>
* verifying stored user <userAlias> ticket <ticketAlias> field "email.from" is visible in "[data-testid='support-page']"
* verifying stored user <userAlias> ticket <ticketAlias> field "description" is visible in an iframe inside "[data-testid='support-page']"

# Verifying Desk ticket <ticketAlias> is listed in channel <channelAlias> for user <userAlias>
* Opening Desk channel <channelAlias> for user <userAlias>
* verifying stored user <userAlias> ticket <ticketAlias> field "title" is visible in "[data-testid='support-page']"

# Verifying Desk channel <channelAlias> lists <ticketAlias> but not <otherTicketAlias> for user <userAlias>
* Verifying Desk ticket <ticketAlias> is listed in channel <channelAlias> for user <userAlias>
* verifying stored user <userAlias> ticket <otherTicketAlias> field "title" is not visible in "[data-testid='support-page']"

# Setting open Desk ticket priority to <priority>
* clicking on "[aria-label='Change priority']"
* clicking on text <priority> in "[data-track-name='SelectRowPriority']"
* waiting for text <priority> to appear in "[aria-label='Change priority']"

# Setting open Desk ticket status to <status>
* clicking on "[aria-label='Change stage']"
* clicking on text <status> in "[data-track-name='SelectRowStage']"
* waiting for text <status> to appear in "[aria-label='Change stage']"

# Changing open Desk ticket priority to <priority> and status to <status>
* Setting open Desk ticket priority to <priority>
* Setting open Desk ticket status to <status>

# Filtering Desk tickets by priority <priority>
* clicking on "[data-testid='desk-filter-priority']"
* clicking on text <priority> in "[data-testid^='priority-filter-']"
* pressing "Escape"

# Filtering Desk tickets by status <status>
* clicking on "[data-testid='desk-filter-status']"
* clicking on text <status> in "[data-track-name='ToggleStageFilter']"
* pressing "Escape"

# Clearing Desk filters
* clicking on "[data-track-name='CLEAR_SUPPORT_FILTERS']"

# Selecting Desk ticket <ticketAlias> in the list for user <userAlias>
* clicking on "[data-track-name='ToggleTicketSelection'] label" inside "[data-track-name='ClickTicketListRow']" showing stored user <userAlias> ticket <ticketAlias> field "title"

# Merging selected Desk tickets into <ticketAlias> for user <userAlias>
* clicking on "[data-track-name='MergeTickets']"
* clicking on stored user <userAlias> ticket <ticketAlias> field "title" in "[data-track-name='SelectMergeParent']"
* clicking on "[data-track-name='ConfirmMergeTickets']"

# Bulk setting priority of selected Desk tickets to <priority>
* clicking on "input[placeholder='Priority']"
* typing <priority> in "input[placeholder='Priority']"
* clicking on text <priority> in "[role='option']"

# Bulk moving selected Desk tickets to stage <stage>
* clicking on "input[placeholder='Stage']"
* typing <stage> in "input[placeholder='Stage']"
* clicking on text <stage> in "[role='option']"

# Opening Desk mailbox folder <folder>
* clicking on text <folder> in "[data-track-name='SelectMailboxFolder']"
